  "deliverable": "MicroBiomeNet: do FUNCTIONAL (FAPROTAX guild) features transfer across geography better than taxonomy? + robustness across many geographic folds.",
  "date": "2026-07-03",
  "question": "Does a function-level representation (FAPROTAX functional guilds inferred from taxonomy) beat the taxonomy baseline (tax_logreg=0.676) for out-of-distribution transfer across held-out geographic regions, and does the taxonomy result hold across many geographic folds?",
